@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
hide footbox
title Summarising income for one month

participant ":PaymentCommands" as Commands
participant ":TutorLedgerData" as Data

[-> Commands : execute("income 10-2026")
activate Commands
Commands -> Commands : income("10-2026")
activate Commands
note right of Commands
  Read MM-YYYY or YYYY.
  A bad period returns an error here.
end note
Commands -> Commands : monthlyIncome(Oct 2026)
activate Commands
Commands -> Data : getLessons()
activate Data
Data --> Commands : all lessons
deactivate Data
note right of Commands
  paidLessons keeps lessons in that month
  that are not cancelled and have amountPaid > 0,
  then sums amountPaid.
end note
Commands --> Commands : total and lesson rows
deactivate Commands
deactivate Commands
Commands -->[ : "Income for October 2026: $..."
deactivate Commands
note over Commands, Data
  Read-only: no record changes, so no automatic save follows.
end note
@enduml
